WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Imisani furemu fhethu ho sendamaho ni swaye hune lutambo lwa pfuka lutanda hone.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Monisani furemu uri milenzhe i shandukise vhudzulo kha zwiṱhavhi zwivhili zwi fanaho nga ngoho, ni swaye hafhu.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.667
Tshiswayo tsha vhuimo vhuthihi tshi vhukati ha zwiswayo zwivhili.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:32.417
Tshimbidzani muṅwe mulenzhe u gonya kana u tsa fhethu ho sendamaho u swikela lutambo lu tshi fhaṱekea kha tshiswayo tsha vhuimo vhuthihi.
